  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [metalsmith-in-place](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place) from `v3.0.1` to `v4.1.1`\n\n**Note**: This PR was created on a configured schedule (\"every weekend\" in timezone `Europe/Paris`) and will not receive updates outside those times.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Release Notes</summary>\n\n### [`v4.0.0`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/releases/4.0.0)\n\nSo this library went through a bit of churny phase, my apologies for that. It was caused by a couple of factors; moving the library to a new home, a new rendering engine and me trying to abstract said rendering engine for reuse in metalsmith-layouts.\n\nHowever, the end result is now a stable plugin, that's easy to use and easy to maintain. Jstransformers are way simpler to debug, and so far I haven't even encountered any bugs. We're not abstracting the rendering engine because it's just not worth it, and confusing apis have been removed. All in all I hope that you'll enjoy this release and feel free to let me know if you encounter anything!\n\n* breaking: dropped node 4 support\n* breaking: the filename property is no longer set automatically, use https://github.com/MoOx/metalsmith-filenames\n* removed metalsmith-engine-jstransformer for ease of maintenance\n\n---\n\n### [`v4.1.0`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/releases/4.1.0)\n\n* add a documentation link to the error messages\n* add debug for better debugging\n\n---\n\n### [`v4.1.1`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/releases/4.1.1)\n\n* documentation fix\n\n---\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n\n#### v4.0.0\n-   [`b43252d`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/b43252dc27749700edc6612fc384bca2691d6dbf) Update for move (#&#8203;124)\n-   [`2bb7857`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/2bb785734aa326880d65dc3df94d54926341d4bd) Update dependencies to enable Greenkeeper 🌴 (#&#8203;125)\n-   [`5ba61b6`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/5ba61b6a5f575d80fe61315fe0a90062589deb18) v4 (#&#8203;120)\n-   [`4c67a73`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/4c67a731d7bc318888b0ed7a45a1fddfc280ee77) Prepare 4.0.0 (#&#8203;129)\n#### v4.1.0\n-   [`1f9cf49`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/1f9cf498b66f26ea91441d897a12a9f8f7309411) Remove lockfile (#&#8203;130)\n-   [`0fed415`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/0fed4150af11103e1a1ad84716a67248630c586c) Ignore package lock (#&#8203;132)\n-   [`f4a1126`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/f4a11267eee3a2e26bd428ad5ccbdb2247a70ac6) Remove babel (#&#8203;133)\n-   [`cc1d46f`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/cc1d46ffe8ea697336470ea13298119f27347574) Add npmrc (#&#8203;134)\n-   [`2b88dfe`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/2b88dfeaf905131355e67818416d8091c14dae64) Update readme (#&#8203;135)\n-   [`a1cc6a9`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/a1cc6a9095cf9f06e843f173b328d4eb088471c3) Add debug (#&#8203;139)\n-   [`f0ee62a`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/f0ee62a987c79a2dcaf63f1d9898019b452f9a00) Prepare 4.1.0 (#&#8203;140)\n#### v4.1.1\n-   [`9bbe3d2`](https://github.com/ismay/metalsmith-in-place/commit/9bbe3d2bd75b126414c8715cd44865660ce712fe) Prepare 4.1.1 (#&#8203;141)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
